334.description:
When creating the game world, the developers based it on the features of Warhammer, with its familiar dark and frightening atmosphere.

Game features
- The central location of the action is the city of Morheim, where lawlessness flourishes and normal and ordinary residents are absent;
- Who won't the player meet in this city, where the absence of law and any hint of order has become a very attractive feature for criminals - thieves, murderers and other elements;
- The arrival of a new resident is regarded by the population as the greatest stupidity and immediately attracts crowds of those seeking profit;
- To survive in this city, the player will have to assemble his own team of killers who are proficient not only in weapons, but also in magic;
- The turn-based combat system is perfectly implemented in the competition between players and the storyline.

Installation:
1. Install the game following the setup instructions.
2. Install add-ons from the DLC folder.
3. Play.
